{"page":380,"verses":[{"verse_key":"27:36","surah":27,"ayah":36,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا جَآءَ سُلَيْمَـٰنَ قَالَ أَتُمِدُّونَنِ بِمَالٍ فَمَآ ءَاتَىٰنِۦَ ٱللَّهُ خَيْرٌ مِّمَّآ ءَاتَىٰكُم بَلْ أَنتُم بِهَدِيَّتِكُمْ تَفْرَحُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When her envoy came to Solomon, Solomon said, ‘What! Are you offering me wealth? What God has given me is better than what He has given you, though you rejoice in this gift of yours.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"So when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"27:36"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَآءَ","en_gloss":"came","transliteration":"jāa","verse_key":"27:36"},{"pos":3,"ar":"سُلَيْمَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"(to) Sulaiman","transliteration":"sulaymāna","verse_key":"27:36"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"he said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"27:36"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَتُمِدُّونَنِ","en_gloss":"Will you provide me","transliteration":"atumiddūnani","verse_key":"27:36"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِمَالٍۢ","en_gloss":"with wealth","transliteration":"bimālin","verse_key":"27:36"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَمَآ","en_gloss":"But what","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"27:36"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ءَاتَىٰنِۦَ","en_gloss":"Allah has given me","transliteration":"ātāniya","verse_key":"27:36"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah has given me","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"27:36"},{"pos":10,"ar":"خَيْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) better","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"27:36"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِّمَّآ","en_gloss":"than what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"27:36"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ءَاتَىٰكُم","en_gloss":"He has given you","transliteration":"ātākum","verse_key":"27:36"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"27:36"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَنتُم","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"antum","verse_key":"27:36"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بِهَدِيَّتِكُمْ","en_gloss":"in your gift","transliteration":"bihadiyyatikum","verse_key":"27:36"},{"pos":16,"ar":"تَفْرَحُونَ","en_gloss":"rejoice","transliteration":"tafraḥūna","verse_key":"27:36"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٣٦","en_gloss":"(36)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:36"}]},{"verse_key":"27:37","surah":27,"ayah":37,"ar_uthmani":"ٱرْجِعْ إِلَيْهِمْ فَلَنَأْتِيَنَّهُم بِجُنُودٍ لَّا قِبَلَ لَهُم بِهَا وَلَنُخْرِجَنَّهُم مِّنْهَآ أَذِلَّةً وَهُمْ صَـٰغِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Go back to your people: we shall certainly come upon them with irresistible forces, and drive them, disgraced and humbled, from their land.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱرْجِعْ","en_gloss":"Return","transliteration":"ir'jiʿ","verse_key":"27:37"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ilayhim","verse_key":"27:37"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَلَنَأْتِيَنَّهُم","en_gloss":"surely, we will come to them","transliteration":"falanatiyannahum","verse_key":"27:37"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِجُنُودٍۢ","en_gloss":"with hosts","transliteration":"bijunūdin","verse_key":"27:37"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"27:37"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قِبَلَ","en_gloss":"(is) resistance","transliteration":"qibala","verse_key":"27:37"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَهُم","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"27:37"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِهَا","en_gloss":"of it","transliteration":"bihā","verse_key":"27:37"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَنُخْرِجَنَّهُم","en_gloss":"and surely, we will drive them out","transliteration":"walanukh'rijannahum","verse_key":"27:37"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّنْهَآ","en_gloss":"from there","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"27:37"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَذِلَّةًۭ","en_gloss":"(in) humiliation","transliteration":"adhillatan","verse_key":"27:37"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"27:37"},{"pos":13,"ar":"صَـٰغِرُونَ","en_gloss":"(will be) abased","transliteration":"ṣāghirūna","verse_key":"27:37"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٣٧","en_gloss":"(37)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:37"}]},{"verse_key":"27:38","surah":27,"ayah":38,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلْمَلَؤُا۟